{"asked":"look","said":{"turn":1,"moment":"inspect","scene":{"lines":["the old quarry pit · Day 1, 8:05 a.m.","A bowl of grey stone cut out of the hill long ago, ivy over its faces. At the bottom a square adit goes back into the rock behind a barred gate. A board on the gate says KEEP OUT in three hands.","Low on the north face, where the ivy has pulled away, is a mark no quarryman cut. It is a wheel with no wing, its strokes worn soft.","No food."],"prose":["A bowl of grey stone cut out of the hill long ago, ivy over its faces. At the bottom a square adit goes back into the rock behind a barred gate. A board on the gate says KEEP OUT in three hands.","Low on the north face, where the ivy has pulled away, is a mark no quarryman cut. It is a wheel with no wing, its strokes worn soft."]},"offer":{"primary":[{"id":"lab__low_u_pit_work(party,lab__low_u_pit)","label":"Work along the faces of the pit, ledge by ledge","aspects":["knowledge"],"type":"act","minutes":60,"marks":[]},{"id":"push(lab__low_u_adit_lock)","label":"Down to the quarry adit — look at the padlock on the adit gate","aspects":["knowledge","exploration"],"type":"act","marks":[]},{"id":"travel:lab__low_shop","label":"To Mik's salt-house","aspects":["exploration"],"type":"journey","minutes":6,"marks":[]},{"id":"go(lab__low_u_pit_path,lab__low_green)","label":"To the landing at Lowmouth","aspects":[],"type":"go","minutes":5,"marks":[]}],"rest":[{"id":"change_thing(lab__low_u_pit_ivy_pull)","label":"Pull the ivy back off the wheel on the north face","aspects":["exploration"],"type":"act","marks":[]},{"id":"travel:lab__low_taproom","label":"To the taproom of the Lucky Phoenix","aspects":["exploration"],"type":"journey","minutes":6,"marks":[]},{"id":"travel:lab__low_chapel","label":"To the chapel of Saint Ide","aspects":["exploration"],"type":"journey","minutes":6,"marks":[]},{"id":"travel:lab__low_u_yard","label":"To the churchyard","aspects":["exploration"],"type":"journey","minutes":6,"marks":[]},{"id":"wait